{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01HCLnkf84bHG16cZPXpzB5A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Here's what was completed:\n\n## ✅ answers/06-error-handling-resilience.md\n\n**10 answers written** (7 Core + 3 Deep) covering:\n\n**Core:**\n1. **Error taxonomy** — Six categories (validation, network, card decline, 3DS auth, fraud, rate limit) with a `classifyStripeError()` TypeScript dispatch function and per-category UX strategy\n2. **Decline code messaging** — `SPECIFIC_DECLINE_MESSAGES` allowlist + `SILENT_DECLINE_CODES` denylist; why `stolen_card` always gets a generic message (anti-card-testing / anti-enumeration)\n3. **3DS challenge flow** — Full state machine with sequence diagram, all failure modes (user cancels, timeout, bank 3DS page down), and `retrievePaymentIntent` recovery\n4. **Timeout vs. definitive failure** — The ambiguous-charge problem, idempotency key persistence in `localStorage`, and a decision flowchart branching on PaymentIntent status\n5. **Stripe.js load failure** — Timeout-wrapped `loadStripe()`, graceful fallback UI, structured Sentry log payload; explains why self-hosting is a PCI violation\n6. **Frontend circuit breaker** — Full TypeScript `CircuitBreaker` class with closed/open/half-open states, `sessionStorage` persistence across refreshes, with state diagram\n7. **Last-step server error UX** — Keeping Elements mounted across errors, \"your card has NOT been charged\" copy, `aria-live` region strategy\n\n**Deep:**\n8. **Full 3DS2 architecture** — Device fingerprinting phase, iframe vs. redirect challenge modes, serializing React state to `sessionStorage` before redirect, recovering via `return_url`\n9. **Offline resilience design** — Pre-flight `navigator.onLine` + Network Information API, idempotency-key-first queuing, retry-on-`online` event, explicit limits of what the frontend can guarantee\n10. **Cross-origin iframe error diagnosis** — What Sentry can/cannot see across SOP boundary, instrumentation around the iframe, segmentation analytics for browser/device correlation, `retrievePaymentIntent` safety check to prevent false \"payment failed\" on charges that actually succeeded\n\n**Next up:** `answers/07-internationalization-localization.md`"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":47360,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":398,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9078f7bd-c9da-4434-af6f-ab88627aea1a","uuid":"924231b6-3b84-47e0-98f8-1e86496026df"}
